//! Runtime material audit for donor tensors, tokenizer inputs, and delta visibility.
//!
//! This module distinguishes four separate states for donor tensor availability:
//! 1. the donor index exists,
//! 2. the resolved shard path exists,
//! 3. the shard file can be opened,
//! 4. the shard contains materialized safetensors payload bytes.
//!
//! A shard may be openable while still being unusable at runtime if the checkout
//! contains Git LFS pointer stubs instead of the actual tensor payload.
//!
//! Therefore `donor_shard_opened = true` must never be interpreted as proof that
//! donor parameters are hot-live. Runtime usability requires at minimum:
//! - donor_shard_payload_materialized = true
//! - donor_tensor_addressed = true
//! - donor_tensor_activated = true

